SUMMARY:Pro Jam with special guest Tony Lindsay
DESCRIPTION:Former Santana lead vocalist brings his own special brand of “feel-good” soul.\nAs lead vocalist for Santana for 25 years\, powerful singer Tony Lindsay won 11 Grammy awards\, traveled on multiple world tours and recorded on 7 Santana albums. He left Santana in 2015 to launch a successful solo career and continues to garner accolades. His 5th CD\, “Something Beautiful\,” earned him four top 10 songs on the Internet Broadcasters’ Alliance’s Indie Soul Chart. \nMusic critic Broderich Hampton called Lindsay’s music “Feel-good\, meaningful soul you can dance to.” \nTickets for this special event are $17 in advance and $20 at the door. $15 for members. No food service.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/pro-jam-with-special-guest-tony-lindsay/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LINDSAY.jpg
GEO:38.44252;-122.71621
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=The California Theatre of Santa Rosa 528 7th Street Santa Rosa CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=528 7th Street:geo:-122.71621,38.44252
END:VEVENT
