SUMMARY:Kameron Marlowe at Mystic Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Gate52 Presents: \nKAMERON MARLOWE \nFt Very Gently \n  \nCountry singer Kameron Marlowe is an earnest performer with a richly textured vocal style. He is best known for competing on season 15 of NBC’s The Voice\, after which he released his gold-selling debut single\, “Giving You Up\,” in 2019. After inking a deal with ‘s imprint\, Marlowe issued his debut album\, We Were Cowboys\, in 2022. It made a strong showing on the country charts\, and he followed it in 2024 with his sophomore set\, Keepin’ the Lights On\, featuring a Hot Country songs duet with Ella Langley\, “Strangers.” His third album\, Sad Songs for the Soul\, arrived in 2025 with the single “Hello Whiskey.” \n  \n  \n 
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/kameron-marlowe-at-mystic-theatre/
LOCATION:Mystic Theatre & Music Hall\, 23 Petaluma Blvd N\, Petaluma\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.2334;-122.64
