SUMMARY:Stephanie Salva at Rio Nido Roadhouse
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a midweek reset at Unwind Wednesday — where great music\, good vibes\, and delicious bites come together on the Russian River. \nEnjoy: \n✨ Small bites & drink specials \n✨ Relaxed outdoor atmosphere \n✨ Live local music \n  \nThis week’s featured artist: \n  \nStephanie Salva\n  \nStephanie Salva is a Northern California–based singer-songwriter known for her soulful vocals\, heartfelt lyrics\, and warm acoustic sound. Blending elements of folk\, indie\, and pop\, she delivers intimate performances that connect deeply with audiences. Whether performing originals or unique covers\, Stephanie brings an authentic\, laid-back energy.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/stephanie-salva-at-rio-nido-roadhouse-5/
LOCATION:Rio Nido Roadhouse\, 14540 Canyon 2 Road\, Rio Nido\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
