SUMMARY:Peacetown continues at HopMonk with Jeffrey Halford & The Healers
DESCRIPTION:Jeffrey Halford delivers a uniquely American melting pot of roots\, blues\, rock and kick-ass pop. Take some Southern soul\, add a heap of Texas storytelling\, a dash of Bay area’s free-wheelin’ spirit /liberal spirit/literary leanings/seedier side\, then throw in some desert sunshine and dirt\, stir with an architect’s eye for detail and durability and you got yourself an idea of why Paste magazine once named him to their Ten Most Influential Artists of The Decade. Halford\, with the Healers\, makes some of the best records today — a beautiful and dark journey through America — like a great vinyl record. \nOver the last 30 years\, Halford has been touring the country with his band\, the Healers. They have played shows with some of music’s most acclaimed artists and songwriters — as well as Halford’s influences — such as Taj Mahal\, Los Lobos\, George Thorogood\, Gregg Allman\, Etta James\, John Hammond\, and Texas Greats Augie Meyers\, Guy Clark and Robert Earl Keen. Like those who came before him\, Halford is attempting to write songs that withstand the test of time.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/peacetown-continues-at-hopmonk-with-jeffrey-halford-the-healers/
LOCATION:HopMonk Tavern – Sebastopol\, 230 Petaluma Ave\, Sebastopol\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
GEO:38.4012;-122.823
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS=HopMonk Tavern – Sebastopol 230 Petaluma Ave Sebastopol CA;X-APPLE-RADIUS=500;X-TITLE=230 Petaluma Ave:geo:-122.823,38.4012
END:VEVENT
