SUMMARY:Uncorked for a Cause with Wiley's Wish and Mutt Lynch Winery
DESCRIPTION:We’re putting together something really special — and it’s all for the dogs 🤍\nWiley’s Wish\, Mutt Lynch Winery\, and Dog Moms of Sonoma County are coming together for a fundraiser + silent auction we’re so excited about — Uncorked for a Cause.\nSave the date: May 8th from 4–7pm\nThis night is all about raising funds to continue the work behind Wiley’s Wish — rescuing\, training\, and showing up every day for dogs who need a second chance.\nWe’re curating a really fun\, thoughtful silent auction (with some good surprises coming 👀)\, and every bid goes directly back to supporting the dogs in our care.\nAnd of course — there will be wine 🍷\, and some of our incredible trained rescue dogs there to meet (the real stars of the show).\nIt’s an easy\, feel-good way to spend an evening while being part of something that truly matters. Join us!
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/uncorked-for-a-cause-with-wileys-wish-and-mutt-lynch-winery/
LOCATION:Mutt Lynch Winery\, 9050 Windsor Road\, Windsor\, CA
CATEGORIES:Other
